<p>Interesting input overall, although I would think that AWCY does have a place here. I mean, the most common depiction of Sarkicism is that they are this nigh-apocalyptic cult that will has trashed the ancient world and will trash the modern world. To see their gods screwed over by anomalous art shows that they are not the be-all and end-all of the Foundation-verse's fate.</p>
